    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="24">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Wi">Wi</ref> 24</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif folcesmannes esne tihte ciricanmannes esne, oþþe ciricanmannes esne tihte folcsmannes esne, his dryhten hine ane his aþe geclensige.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a layman’s servant brings a charge against a churchman’s servant, or a churchman’s servant brings a charge against a layman’s servant, his lord should clear him by his oath alone.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif folcesmannes esne tihte ciricanmannes esne, oþþe ciricanmannes esne tihte folcesmannes esne, his dryhten hine ane his aþe geclensige.</ab>
      </div>
